<p>Log in to your WordPress admin here: {{ login_url }}</p>'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['paid-memberships-pro',1]],'The site administrator can manually update a user\'s membership level through the WordPress admin. This email notifies the site administrator of the level update.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['paid-memberships-pro',1]],'Order #{{ order_id }} at {{ sitename }} has been REFUNDED'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['paid-memberships-pro',1]],'Refund'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['paid-memberships-pro',1]],'<p>Order #{{ order_id }} at {{ sitename }} has been refunded.</p>

